1 NAME Constantia Eriksdotter /Vasa/
2 GIVN Constantia Eriksdotter
2 SURN Vasa
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Odenfors
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Vreta Kloster
3 CTRY Sverige
1 BIRT
