2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.archive.org/stream/ttartaflorfverd00wasagoog#page/n146/mode/2up 
2 CONT
2 CONT Christer Boije af Gennäs visited New Sweden during a period of 14 months. He arrived February 15 1643 with Fama and returned May 1644 with Fama's next voyage:
2 CONT * http://www.archive.org/stream/cu31924092229214#page/238/mode/2up/search/christer
2 CONT * http://www.archive.org/stream/cu31924092229214#page/n619/mode/2up/search/christer
2 CONT * http://www.archive.org/stream/cu31924092229222#page/820/mode/2up/search/christer 
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial/Hautaus/Begravning: http://hiski.genealogia.fi/hiski?fi+t5707045 
2 CONT
2 CONT September 27, 1681 is most likely the date when his coffin was finally placed in the grave (possibly in Pernå Church, where the family had their burial place), even though he died in 1679. This was common to either coordinate buri
2 CONC als or wait for a suitable grave to be completed.
