2 CONT
2 CONT Karin Månsdotter (In Finnish:Kaarina Maununtytär), (November 6, 1550–September 13, 1612) was Queen of Sweden and wife of Eric XIV of Sweden.
2 CONT
2 CONT Karin was the daughter of the jailkeeper Måns (her last name simply means "daughter of Måns") and his wife Ingrid, peasants in Uppland. She was at one point employed as a waitress at the tavern of Gert Cantor before she was employ
2 CONC ed at court. She was working as a maid to the King's sister, Princess Elizabeth, when she became mistress to the king in 1565.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents
2 CONT
