1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =KATHARINA von Sachsen-Lauenburg=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Katarina of Saxony-Lauenburg
2 CONT
2 CONT * Queen in Sweden 1531-36. Became 21 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Parents: Magnus I of Saxony-Lauenburg (1468 - 1543) & Katarina of Braunschweig-Wolfenbüttel (1488 - 1563)
2 CONT * Born:	1513-09-24 Germany, Ratzeburg	
2 CONT
2 CONT * Death:	1535-09-23 Stockholm  1)	
2 CONT
2 CONT * Buried:	1560-12-21 Uppsala, Uppsala Cathedral, Uppland  2)	Buried first in Stockholm's Storkyrka.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000000695074691?album_type=photos_of_me&end=&photo_id=6000000174312499933&project_id=&start=&tagged_profiles= '''King Gustav Vasa Eriksson''']  on 1531-09-24 in Stockholm, Stockholm'
2 CONC s Storkyrka  3). Gustav I Vasa . Governor of Sweden in the years 1521-08-13 to 1523-06-06. King of Sweden in the years 1523-06-06 to 1560-09-29. Married (1): o 1531-09-24 in Stockholm with Princess Katarina of Saxony-Lauenburg . D
2 CONC aughter of Duke Magnus I of Saxony-Lauenburg and Katarina of Braunschweig-Wolfenbüttel . GUSTAF Eriksson, son of ERIK Johansson & his wife Cecilia Magnusdotter (Lindholmen 12 May 1496-Stockholm 29 Sep 1560).  Regent of Sweden 1521
2 CONC -23.  He succeeded 7 Jun 1523 as GUSTAF I King of Sweden married (firstly) in Stockholm 24 Sep 1531 '''KATHARINA von Sachsen-Lauenburg,''' daughter of MAGNUS II Herzog von Sachsen-Lauenburg & his wife Katharina von Braunschweig-Wo
2 CONC lfenbüttel (24 Sep 1513-Stockholm 23 Sep 1535). 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SWEDEN.htm#GustafIdied1560B Projects MedLands Sweden Project MedLands SWEDEN] 
2 CONT
2 CONT =1 Child born to King Gustav I Vasa and Queen Katarina, Drottning av Sverige=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''ERIK Prince of Sweden''' (Stockholm 13 Dec 1533-poisoned Örbyhus 26 Feb 1577).  He succeeded his father in 1560 as ERIK XIV King of Sweden.  He was deposed in 1569.  '''married  (4 Jul 1568) KARIN Mansdotter, daughter of  ? (
2 CONC 6 Nov 1550-Liuksala, Finland 13 Sep 1612).'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Erik XIV & his wife KARIN Mansdotter had four children:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT *  a)         '''SIGRID''' (15 Oct 1566-24 Apr 1633).  '''married firstly (1597) HENRIK Tott till Sjundley,''' son of --- (-[1600/01]).  '''married secondly (1609) NILS Nilsson till Bro [Natt och Dag],''' son of --- (-18 Apr 1613)
2 CONC .
2 CONT * b)         '''GUSTAF''' (28 Jan 1568-Kaschin, Russia 22 Feb 1607).
2 CONT * c)         '''HENRIK''' (24 Jan 1570-1574).
2 CONT * d)         '''ARNOLD''' (1 Nov 1572-1573).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Erik XIV had four children by Agda Persdotter his Royal Mistress:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT *  e)         '''VIRGINIA''' (1559-1633)  '''married  (1585/6) HAKON Knutsson Hand (-1595/6).'''
2 CONT *  f)          '''CONSTANTIA''' (1560-1649).  '''married ([1594]) HENRIK Frankelin''' (-1610).
2 CONT * g)         '''LUCRETIA''' (1564-).  '''married  --- Zelow'''  
2 CONT *  h)         '''MARGARETA''' (-1618).  '''married  (1592) OLAVIUS Simonis (-1639).'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''' - [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Vasa Vasa Geneology- Adelsvapen, Tab 8 & 9]
2 CONT
