1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Lenck_nr_448
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genes.se/Wihlborg/index.htm?/Wihlborg/000/0012/410.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.st-andrews.ac.uk/history/ssne/item.php?id=4359&id2=4359
2 CONT
2 CONT Fr www.st-andrews.ac.uk: Jakob Lenck junior was born 1624, the son of Major James Lenck [SSNE 4358] and his wife Maria Hard. In 1649 he was ennobled and introduced into the Riddarhus under nr.448. From 1655-7 he served as a cornet
2 CONC  in the Ostgota cavalry. He later became captain of horse. He died in 1676. Various sources say he was married to Marta Hard of Torestorp and Constantine Frankelin, grand-daughter of Henrik Frankelin [SSNE 4782], although there is
2 CONC  clearly confusion here with his father.  ..........................................................................  Svenska Adelns Attartavlor, vol. 2, p.817 and vol. 4, p.519; H. Marryat, One Year in Sweden, including a visit t
2 CONC o the isle of Gotland (London, 1862), p.492; F. Fryxell, Wermelandia Nobilitata, (Landsarkivet, Gothenburg, 1945), p.35; F. Rudelius, 'Kalmar Regementes Personhistoria 1623-1927 (2 vols., Norköping, 1952) I, p.44.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Jakob Lenck, naturaliserad Lenck, till Frölunda i Tidavads socken och Ramsnäs i Finnerödja socken (båda i Skaraborgs län), vilket senare han erhöll genom sitt gifte. Född 1624-07-10. Naturaliserad svensk adelsman 1649-02-21 (intro
2 CONC ducera 1649 under nr 448). Var 1655 och ännu 1657 kornett vid Östgöta ryttare. Ryttmästare. Död 1676. Gift 1657 på Ramsnäs med Constantia Frankelin, född 1631 om hösten Bocksjöholm, död 1681, dotter av majoren Carl Frankelin, och 
2 CONC Elisabet Polana.
