2 CONT '''Albrekt Georg Duwall'''
2 CONT född 1619. Student i Uppsala (Um.) 1636-06-07. Kaptenlöjtnant. Död ogift 1640 (Medd. av assessor O. Adelborg.) i Tyskland. [Elgenstierna]
2 CONT
2 CONT Albrecht was born in 1619.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Jakob Mac-Dougall and Anna Berge
2 CONT
2 CONT Lieutenant Albrecht Georg Mack Duwalt died in a duel on December 4, 1643 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death 1643 Germany:
2 CONT
2 CONT Gravestone location :
2 CONT The gravestone lies in the chancel of St. Marien Church in front of the high altar. Its upper end faces west. Gardelegen.
2 CONT
2 CONT ''"Albrecht Georg Mack Duwalt
2 CONT Schwedischer Offizier
2 CONT Sterbedatum:04.12.1643
2 CONT Konfession:evangelisch	Ort:Gardelegen, St. Marien
2 CONT Standort:Marienkirche	GPS:11.395096 - 52.524903"''
2 CONT
2 CONT Cf. Schultze, "Auff- und Abnehmen der löblichen Stadt Gardelegen" (printed in Stendal by Andreas Güssow in 1668, reprinted in 1995 by Märkischer Kunst- und Heimatverlag Kalbe/Milde – Hechthausen), pp. 152ff; Beckmann, "Historische
2 CONC  Beschreibung der Chur und Margrave Brandenburg," p. 64; and Enders, "Die Altmark," BWV-Verlag 2008, p. 69.
