2 CONT Dorothea (Sachsen-Lauenburg) af Danmark is a member of aristocracy in Europe.
2 CONT Join: European Royals and Aristocrats 1500-Present Project Discuss: EUROARISTO Biography Dorothea was the eldest daughter of Magnus I, Herzog (Duke) von Sachsen-Lauenburg of the Askanier (Ascanian) dynasty and his wife Katharina v
2 CONC on Braunschweig-Wolfenbüttel, and was born on 9 July 1511.
