2 CONT * Son of Major Carl Jönsson Svinhufvud i Västergötland and Margareta Svenske 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000003897396773?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000190940006922 '''Jöns Carlsson Svinhufvud was a Major in 1645''']
