2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003897396773&photo_id=6000000190256646868&position=0 '''RIKSDAGSPROTOKOLL, page 151''']
2 CONT * Born 1622 in Steneby/P. Sweden died 1659-06-27 in Bromshöög Zeeland, Copenhagen/Denmark.
2 CONT * Father: Carl was born in 1585, in Steneby Steneby Sweden and his Mother: Margaret was born in 1600, in Hestra, Vastra Gotaland, Sweden. Jöns had 7 siblings: Christina Roos Av Hjälmsäter (born Carlsdotter Svinhufvud), Carl Carlss
2 CONC on Svinhufvud, Brita Carlsdotter Svinhufvud, Johan Carlsson Svinhufvud, Margateta Biörn (born CarlsdotterSvinhufvud) and 2 other siblings.
2 CONT
