2 CONT * Married: [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003897396773&photo_id=6000000116576666831&position=5 '''BEATA Persdotter Gyllensvärd'''] on December 13,1646 in Åsundenleden Sweden.  BEATA was born in 
2 CONC 1622, in Bolmsö, Kronobergs län. Jöns passed away on June 27 1659, at age 37 in Bromshög, Själland. Beata . Lived widow in 1698. Married to the major Jöns Svinhufvud in Västergötland, no. 199, died 1698 in Steneby (P), Jöns» Karls
2 CONC son-Svinhuvud (AF Västergötland).  Tavla1 born 1622 in Steneby (P). Died 1659-06-27 in Copenhagen, Denmark.
2 CONT * Source: [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003897396773&photo_id=6000000204156302859&position=0 '''Värmlands regementes (Närkes och Värmlands regementes) historia, Volumes 1-2 By Carl Otto Nordens
2 CONC van.''']
2 CONT
