2 CONT
2 CONT *  '''Elizabeth Jonsdotter Svinhufvud,''' born in 1647 in Röksberg, Mulseryd förs, Jönköpings län (F), Sverige (Sweden)
2 CONT * '''Johan Magnus Jönsson-Svinhuvud (af Västergötland),''' born on 11 April 1649 in Röksberg, Mulseryd förs, Jönköpings län (F), Sverige (Sweden) & died on 1682 i Mulseryd (F) Sweden.
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003897396711&photo_id=6000000089040702855&position=1 '''Maria Catharina Jonsdotter Svinhufvud'''] born on April 11, 1649 inSolberga in Mo härad, Mulseryd förs, J
2 CONC önköpings län (F), Sweden & died onFebruary 11, 1720 (70) in Lilla Duvhult, Femsjö, Halland, Sweden. She married Captain Johan Carl Gyntersson Rosenschantz.
2 CONT * '''Carl Jönsson Svinhufvud'''
2 CONT * '''Grace Jonsdotter Svinhufvud,''' born after June 17,1659 is apparent from the letter she sent to Per Brahe on 29 June, where she tells them her husband Jons has died on June 17, 1659 and she has given birth to a small daughter
2 CONC  and wishes Per Brahe to be her Godfather. Grace was baptized on July 3 1659. (Daughter Grace never reached adulthood)
2 CONT
