1 NAME Maria till Limsta /Roquette/
2 GIVN Maria till Limsta
2 SURN Roquette
2 _MARNM Hägerstierna
1 SEX F
1 BAPM
2 DATE 29 MAR 1644
2 ADDR
3 CITY Stockholm
3 STAE Uppland
3 CTRY Sweden
1 BIRT
2 DATE 29 MAR 1644
2 ADDR
