2 CONT [http://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=3&otsing_id=20190128165255029778&id=124031779087&active=1&query=fincke&naita_ridu=&sess_id=b0fdbd0ed088fe442c36b777b7103e5f TLA.230.1-I.1164]
2 CONT
