2 CONT m. 1stly 1764 baroness Sophie Renate von Wrangell (in her 2nd marriage, m. 1stly Bartholomaeus Wilhelm Bielsky, of Ruil in Estonia. She was bur. 6 Sep 1765); 
2 CONT
