1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.colonialswedes.se/Olof_Stille.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Per Stille, father of Olaf, lived on the island of SoIö in Roslagen, northeast of Stockholm. He was a relatively prosperous supervisor of the Penningby estate in Länna parish. By 1627 Per Stille had retired and was granted land by
2 CONC  the owners of Penningby on a nearby island called Humblö. His son, Olaf, traveled to New Sweden with his family. His sister appeared to be in the same group married to Mans Svensson Lom.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Pers (Peder) Persson Stille II was born in Penningby Manor in Ruslagen, Sweden in 1583 to parents Per Stille (1546-1590) and Brigitta (Unknown) . He married Britta Nilsdotter about 1606 in Sweden. They had seven children together:
2 CONC  Anna Petersdotter Stille (1605-1703), Margaret Petersdotter Stille (1607-1687), Olaf Persson “of Penningby and Humlo” Stille (1610-1684), Anders Persson Stille (1611-?), Axel Persson Stille (1612-1683), Kerstin Petersdotter Still
2 CONC e (1613-1687), and Johan Persson Stille 1615-1672).
2 CONT
2 CONT Pers passed away about 1632 on his Humblo Farm in Roslagen, Stockholm, Sweden (some references give his date of death as a range 1631-1635)
2 CONT Excerpted Notations re: Biography of Pers Persson Stille II: “The name Stilley is a Swedish name that is the Anglicized version of the name Stille. Pers Stille was born circa 1584 in Sweden. He died circa 1631-1635 at the Humblo F
2 CONC arm, in Roslagen, Sweden. His wife's name was Britta and they had at least five children: Axel, Anna, Johan, Kerstin, and Olof/Olaf. He and his family lived on the island of Solo, in Roslagen, Sweden. Pers was the supervisor of th
2 CONC e Penningby estate in Sweden and when he retired in about 1627, he was given a farm on the island of Humblo, Sweden. Pers died there in about the 1630's. Pers married Britta. They had the following children: 1. Olaf/Olof Persson S
2 CONC tille, 2. Kerstin Stille, 3. Johan Stille, 4. Anna Stille, 5. Axel Stille”......excerpted
2 CONT
2 CONT There is another daughter Petersdotter Stille (LZX4-6JV), but the system does not let me list her with the children. She is sealed to them.
