0 @N6000000006127291379@ NOTE Föddes omkring 1492 i Örebro, Örebro län, Sverige, died before 1544, married 1stly Göran Hansson Stiernsköld; married 2ndly Krister Hansson Horn; married 3rdly Åke Klasson ThottBarn med Göran Stiernsköld:1. Catharina Göransdotter 
